erfect for household repairs, furniture assembly, electronic device maintenance, and more.</p><p><span style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 23px;\">Key Features</span></p><ul><li><b>High Torque Output:</b> Equipped with a powerful motor delivering 5N·m of torque, ideal for medium-duty tasks like furniture assembly and appliance repair.</li><li><b>Efficient Speed:&nbsp;</b>Operates at 200 RPM, allowing for fast screwdriving without sacrificing control.</li><li><b>Large Capacity Battery:&nbsp;</b>Built-in 2000mAh lithium battery supports up to 180 screws per full charge. Recharges in just 2 hours with Type-C fast charging.</li><li><b>Magnetic Bit Storage:&nbsp;</b>Comes with a 12-piece precision S2 steel bit set, easily stored in the magnetic case for convenience and portability.</li><li><b>LED Ring Light:&nbsp;</b>Built-in three-point LED lighting provides shadow-free illumination for accurate work in dark or tight spaces.</li><li><b>Durable Aluminum Alloy Body:&nbsp;</b>CNC-machined aluminum housing offers a premium feel and long-lasting durability.</li><li><b>Safety Lock &amp; Forward/Reverse Switch:&nbsp;</b>Intuitive one-button operation with a physical switch to prevent accidental activation.</li></ul><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"></p><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"></p><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"></p><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"></p><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-4.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"></p><p><img src=\"/image/catalog/Xiaomi/ScrewDriver/XioamiScrewDriver-1000x1000-5.jpg\" style=\"width: 1000px;\"><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4",